	(text "Bus IN/OUT: J1 and J2 pins joined by wide planes, 15 A pass-through.\nNo on-board inrush limiting: external XT90-S anti-spark at the supply.\nXT30 + / - per LCSC footprint: confirm on a real part before layout."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 152.4 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "73719ea0-790f-4f03-81bd-214b29cbbef1")
	)
	(text "Bulk: 4 x 47 uF 80 V polymer (2.7 A ripple, 30 mOhm) + 6 x 4.7 uF 100 V X7R 1210.\nCap ripple about 13 A RMS at 20 A RMS phase; 80 V >= 1.2 x 54 V hard trip.\nPlace the 4.7 uF parts at the bridge high-side drains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 76.2 165.1 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "974c2a47-5b98-4391-87f0-48b18957de04")
	)
	(text "LM5008A buck, 5 V out, 10 to 52 V in (SNVS583H 8.2 procedure, Fig. 10 topology):\nVOUT = 2.5 V x (R4 + R3) / R4 = 5.0 V   (R3 = RFB2 VOUT-FB, R4 = RFB1 FB-GND)\nR1 = RT 180k: Fs = VOUT / (1.385e-10 x RT) = 200 kHz; ton at 52 V = 479 ns > 400 ns\nL1 = 120 uH: ripple 188 mA p-p at 52 V; Isat 850 mA > 610 mA max current limit\nR2 = RCL 383k: Toff = 1e-5 / (0.285 + 2.5 / (6.35e-6 x RCL)) = 7.5 us\nR5 = 1 Ohm in series with C15: >= 25 mV p-p ripple at FB\nC11 1 uF + C12 0.1 uF at VIN, C13 0.47 uF VCC, C14 10 nF BST-SW (TI Table 1)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 190.5 0.0000)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8b903642-657f-4025-ad64-7ef5cf6e7de0")
	)
	(text "Diode-OR: buck 5 V or USB 5 V; neither back-feeds the other.\nAP2112K: 1 uF X7R on VIN and VOUT, EN tied to VIN (Diodes datasheet, Note 4)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 241.3 0.0000)
